# This project's guarantees are stated in bytes, not in lines.
#
# The sealed runtime image, the generated plugin directory and the release
# self-scan inventory are all verified by comparing or hashing exact file
# contents. Git's automatic CRLF translation would make those contents depend
# on which platform performed the checkout, so a Windows working tree would
# disagree with a Linux one about files neither had modified.
#
# Normalising to LF everywhere removes that variable. Every file committed to
# this repository already uses LF, so this pins existing behaviour rather than
# changing it, and nothing here needs CRLF: the Windows sources are C#,
# MSBuild project files and one Inno Setup script, all of which accept LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never translate or diff these as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
